[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10800.389, "timestamp": "03:00:00", "text": "不。什么？不，不，不。并非无声"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10802.63, "timestamp": "03:00:02", "text": "溪流。我对此没意见，但我想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10805.59, "timestamp": "03:00:05", "text": "这款麦克风工作起来很顺畅。不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10807.67, "timestamp": "03:00:07", "text": "麦克风。就像所有这些一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10809.99, "timestamp": "03:00:09", "text": "例如，这些是一样的吗？我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10815.51, "timestamp": "03:00:15", "text": "好吧，你知道吗？我们来查一下是什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10819.51, "timestamp": "03:00:19", "text": "是音频手段。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10821.51, "timestamp": "03:00:21", "text": "是的，显然你的音频开启了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10825.269, "timestamp": "03:00:25", "text": "水位很低。所以请调高音量。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10828.469, "timestamp": "03:00:28", "text": "我的音量感觉很小。是的。呃，关于你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10830.95, "timestamp": "03:00:30", "text": "流媒体播放时，请检查音量是否正常。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10832.51, "timestamp": "03:00:32", "text": "我会降低我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10834.269, "timestamp": "03:00:34", "text": "如果音频"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10838.23, "timestamp": "03:00:38", "text": "可能的。我以为我真的让你……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10839.15, "timestamp": "03:00:39", "text": "选择"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10842.23, "timestamp": "03:00:42", "text": "是Discord那个东西，对吧？只有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10844.63, "timestamp": "03:00:44", "text": "Discord音频。所以降低仅"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10846.71, "timestamp": "03:00:46", "text": "使用的是Discord音频，而不是桌面音频。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10850.95, "timestamp": "03:00:50", "text": "哦，等等。这是你的音频电平吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10853.429, "timestamp": "03:00:53", "text": "是的，在你的直播流里，这有点像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10858.95, "timestamp": "03:00:58", "text": "这样别人就听不到你说话了。"}]